{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 2, "text": "这首咒牛经是在古谢的砍牛场上唸唱的，唱完了即砍牛。", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 567, "w": 994, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这首咒牛经是在古谢的砍牛场上唸唱的，唱完了即砍牛。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 567, "w": 994, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 3, "text": "古谢时为什么用牛来祭祖呢？这首经词唱得很清楚。大意是：在", "bbox_px": {"x": 198, "y": 630, "w": 1132, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "古谢时为什么用牛来祭祖呢？这首经词唱得很清楚。大意是：在", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 198, "y": 630, "w": 1132, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 4, "text": "远古时期，人和猿（即野人）还同居一处。由于食物 缺少，老人死", "bbox_px": {"x": 119, "y": 689, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "远古时期，人和猿（即野人）还同居一处。由于食物 缺少，老人死", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 119, "y": 689, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 5, "text": "了，大家共分肉来吃。人去吃过猿人父母的肉。到人的父母死了，猿", "bbox_px": {"x": 122, "y": 745, "w": 1205, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了，大家共分肉来吃。人去吃过猿人父母的肉。到人的父母死了，猿", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 122, "y": 745, "w": 1205, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 6, "text": "（野人）知道后，就上门来要肉吃。人不忍拿父母肉来吃，悄悄做棺", "bbox_px": {"x": 135, "y": 808, "w": 1192, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（野人）知道后，就上门来要肉吃。人不忍拿父母肉来吃，悄悄做棺", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 135, "y": 808, "w": 1192, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 7, "text": "材来埋老人。于是双方争执起来。由于人吃过猿人父母的肉，讲不过", "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 867, "w": 1209, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "材来埋老人。于是双方争执起来。由于人吃过猿人父母的肉，讲不过", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 867, "w": 1209, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 8, "text": "理去，于是提出用牛来替换父母肉，猿同意了。这才算了一桩事。从", "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 930, "w": 1208, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "理去，于是提出用牛来替换父母肉，猿同意了。这才算了一桩事。从", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 930, "w": 1208, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 9, "text": "此以后，人与猿就分开了。为了抵偿这一笔债，为了让老人死后到阴", "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 989, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此以后，人与猿就分开了。为了抵偿这一笔债，为了让老人死后到阴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 989, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 362, "line_no": 10, "text": "间去不受猿魂的打扰，就兴起古谢时砍牛超度亡灵的风俗来。", "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 1045, "w": 1074, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "间去不受猿魂的打扰，就兴起古谢时砍牛超度亡灵的风俗来。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 115, "y": 1045, "w": 1074, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
